# Risk Assessment

Each acquisition receives an operational risk score.

## Risk Levels

### Low

Ready for Title Review.

---

### Medium

Minor issues requiring follow-up.

---

### High

Significant concerns requiring management review.

---

### Critical

Acquisition should not proceed until resolved.

---

# Recommendation

Every Due Diligence review concludes with one recommendation:

- Proceed to Title Review
- Proceed with Conditions
- Additional Research Required
- Hold Acquisition
- Reject Acquisition

