# Business Rules

## Rule 1

A Due Diligence review cannot begin until the PSA has been fully executed.

---

## Rule 2

Every required checklist item must be completed before submission.

---

## Rule 3

Deals with a **Critical** risk rating require Acquisition Manager approval.

---

## Rule 4

Only reviews marked **Proceed to Title Review** may advance to the Title Review module.

---

## Rule 5

Every review action is recorded in the audit log.

